<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33014" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτίνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τείσω</span>: aor. 1
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέτεισα</span>: pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτέτεικα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					40.52
				</span></i>
			:— <i>pay off, pay in full</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζημίην] χίλια τάλαντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.92
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐεργεσίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.47
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄργει δ᾽ ἐκτίνων τροφάς</span>
			<i>making a return for</i> bringing one up, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				548
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάριτας πατρῴας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					453
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφεῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					520b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκ τινα τῖσαι ἀμοιβήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Maiist.
					40
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκην ἐ</span>. <i>pay full</i>
			penalty, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				260
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				23.14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>
			<i>for</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.94
			</span></i>; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίσιν ἐ. τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.72
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄποινα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				79
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. βλάβην</span>
			<i>to make</i> it <i>good</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				936e
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1562
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				1582
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ βλάβος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.43
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκην ἐ. ὑπὲρ χρημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					10.15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>exact full payment for</i> a thing,
			<i>avenge</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				547
			</span></i>; <i>take vengeance on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Med.</u>
					267
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὕβριν</span>
			<i>wreak</i> despite, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				304
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
